<title>PHILIPPINES: Hong Leong unit buys 63.36 pct of Atlas.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong unit buys 63.36 pct of Atlas.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HLG Capital (Phils) Inc, a unit of the Hong Leong group of Malaysia, had decided to buy 63.36 percent of the capital of Atlas Feriliser Corp, HLG's legal counsel said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We wish to inform you that HLG Capital (Phils) Inc has accepted the tender of approximately 63.36 percent of the outstanding capital stock of Atlas ... from various shareholders of AFC in accordance with the terms of the tender offer,&quot; lawyer Jose Salvador Mirasol told the Philippine Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>HLG bought the shares at 36.46 centavos per share.</p>
<p>Atlas A and B shares were being traded at 91 centavos by late Wednesday session.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
